@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = replace-with-jwt-token
@demandeId = 1

### These endpoints are protected.
### Use a JWT from users.http and an existing pending demand id.

### Accept one pending demand
POST {{baseUrl}}/demands/{{demandeId}}/accepter
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Refuse one pending demand with reason
POST {{baseUrl}}/demands/{{demandeId}}/refuser
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "raisonRefus": "Profil non adapte pour le moment"
}

### Refuse without reason (backend normalizes reason)
POST {{baseUrl}}/demands/{{demandeId}}/refuser
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{}

### Non-existing demand
POST {{baseUrl}}/demands/999/accepter
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Non-existing demand with refuse endpoint
POST {{baseUrl}}/demands/999/refuser
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "raisonRefus": "Non trouvée"
}
